# The first watchdog's patrol (city.c, patrol_entry: a loop round the block south of the entry),
# seen from inside its loop: booted on 0B00 (row B, column 0, the loop's west side). Its first stop
# is over 0A00, just north: turned left to face it, looking up a little, shots as it waits and
# flies its loop, its beam a square pyramid of light on the roofs (2026-11-17). It flies down this
# side last, over you: its beam finds you (red beam, red glow)
boot_at 0B00
wait_up
wait 0.5
hold left 0.5
wait 0.3
shot wd_00_north
wait 1.0
shot wd_01
hold right 0.5
wait 0.5
shot wd_02_out
wait 1.5
shot wd_03
hold right 0.5
wait 0.5
shot wd_04_south
wait 1.5
shot wd_05
wait 1.5
shot wd_06
wait 1.5
shot wd_07
wait 1.5
shot wd_08
wait 1.5
shot wd_09
wait 1.5
shot wd_10
wait 1.5
shot wd_11
wait 0.5
shot wd_12
wait 0.5
shot wd_13
wait 0.5
shot wd_14
wait 0.5
shot wd_15
wait 0.5
shot wd_16
wait 0.5
shot wd_17
wait 1.0
shot wd_18
wait 1.0
shot wd_19
# Stood still in its beam: it chases (holding back, you in its beam), and after 2 s in it you're
# caught: the terminal screen, then back at your checkpoint, the entry roof (step 2: the debug
# line's row 8, "wd", is each watchdog's mood and catch count)
wait 1.0
shot wd_20
wait 1.0
shot wd_21
wait 1.0
shot wd_22
wait 2.0
shot wd_23
wait 2.0
shot wd_24
